{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_054_1000_040tam", "source_sha256": "dfbfbb3a061074eb0ceed61111040e60b9cde3f4009eef9da6544f344edb1433", "ja": "聞いて聞いてー！\nたまきの作文、\n学校でほめられたんだ！　くふふ♪", "zh": "听我说听我说——！\n环的作文，\n在学校被表扬了！嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_054_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "9b1448df4c69da3e4dcf91903d2a4c20b60febf3bf4b1b13e2ad6b38b81cd670", "ja": "わぁ～！　よかったね環ちゃん！\nどんな作文を書いたの？", "zh": "哇～！太好了呢，环！\n写了什么样的作文呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_054_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "5d1124d29df80cf0b061fa825f667fc34a0c241c513d8b029e56f2e3f25936a7", "ja": "えっとね、『ありがとう』の\n作文だったから、たまき、\nおやぶんのこと書いたんだぞっ！", "zh": "那个，我写的是《谢谢》的作文，所以环写了关于老大的事哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_054_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "4468d1bafb3ca6c3ccb77846942a9703f7b73e56ee0caabc9fb78ebeb91dfdd7", "ja": "お兄ちゃんのこと？\nふーん……。まあ、お仕事は\nがんばってくれてるもんね。", "zh": "哥哥的事？  \n嗯……不过，你工作上确实一直很努力嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_054_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "b0c58b3d051a62ef42861e330dc390df47c2e2afa22f6918925553f2ab6b6cc7", "ja": "でも、お仕事なんだから\nがんばるのはトーゼンだよ。\nべつに、お礼なんて……", "zh": "不过，既然是工作，努力也是理所当然的。\n也没什么好道谢的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_054_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "f55cc297a468118850030ace889770e97b3d20a4d4a8b6e978b68ea75444bb70", "ja": "でも、おかあさんがいってたよ。\n気持ちを言葉にするのは\n大事だって！", "zh": "但是，妈妈说过呀。\n把心情说出来是很重要的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
